{"unit_id":"zhangyqjiaoshou-oss__dsh-model-sync#card-zh","repo":"zhangyqjiaoshou-oss/dsh-model-sync","commit":"f57261fd77fed2964d1df64443d66586fc43c607","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-sync 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的模型供应商同步插件，在设置页提供 Model Sync 面板，并可在会话打开时自动运行。它通过 DSH 的模型发现接口查询已配置供应商的模型，再将发现结果替换保存的模型列表，同时保留供应商其他配置。用户可以手动同步全部供应商、查看新增和移除数量，并开启带防抖的自动同步；单个供应商查询失败时会保留其原有配置。适合需要让 DSH 中模型列表跟随供应商接口更新的用户。需要先在 DSH 配置供应商，无需插件专用密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:138-224","src/index.ts:108-155"]}
{"unit_id":"zhangyqjiaoshou-oss__dsh-model-sync#card-en","repo":"zhangyqjiaoshou-oss/dsh-model-sync","commit":"f57261fd77fed2964d1df64443d66586fc43c607","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-model-sync refreshes DSH provider model lists through discovery. Its web Settings panel supports manual and conversation-open sync. Discovered models replace the saved list while other provider settings remain; failed queries leave that provider unchanged. Configure providers in DSH first.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:60-117","src/index.ts:108-155"]}
