{"unit_id":"zhangyqjiaoshou-oss__dsh-model-sync#feature-1","repo":"zhangyqjiaoshou-oss/dsh-model-sync","commit":"f57261fd77fed2964d1df64443d66586fc43c607","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-sync 的功能「手动同步模型」：在设置页打开 Model Sync 面板并点击 Sync All Models，插件逐个查询已配置供应商的模型目录，显示每家新增、移除和总数。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:60-117","src/client/index.ts:138-209"]}
{"unit_id":"zhangyqjiaoshou-oss__dsh-model-sync#feature-2","repo":"zhangyqjiaoshou-oss/dsh-model-sync","commit":"f57261fd77fed2964d1df64443d66586fc43c607","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-sync 的功能「会话打开时自动同步」：用户在设置面板打开自动同步开关后，每次会话启动事件触发模型发现并更新列表；两次自动同步至少间隔配置的防抖时间。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:120-135","src/index.ts:158-194"]}
{"unit_id":"zhangyqjiaoshou-oss__dsh-model-sync#feature-3","repo":"zhangyqjiaoshou-oss/dsh-model-sync","commit":"f57261fd77fed2964d1df64443d66586fc43c607","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-sync 的功能「替换模型目录并隔离失败」：同步成功时以接口发现的模型完整替换旧列表并保留其他供应商字段；某家查询失败时保留该家原设置并报告错误。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:121-146"]}
{"unit_id":"zhangyqjiaoshou-oss__dsh-model-sync#caveat-1","repo":"zhangyqjiaoshou-oss/dsh-model-sync","commit":"f57261fd77fed2964d1df64443d66586fc43c607","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-sync 使用发现到的模型列表整体替换已保存列表，因此供应商接口未返回的旧模型会被移除；其他供应商字段会保留。（见 src/index.ts:128-139）","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:128-139"]}
